  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "(With Google Translation)\n\nSince April of this year, the following problems have been occurring:\n\n･It takes around a minute to start VRChat\n\n･It takes around a minute to load other player's avatar\n\n･It takes around a minute to see player's profile, world's detail\n\n･It takes around a minute to join the world\n\n･It takes around a minute to load the world\n\n･Data cannot be cached when the world was loaded\n\nAfter these problems occur, clearing the cache or reinstalling VRChat will temporarily fix the problem, but they will reoccur the next day.\n\nThere is no problem with the internet connection(around 300Mbps).\n\nThe storage capacity for caching world data is nearly 100GB, which should be enough.\n\nNone of my friends knew anything about this issue.",
